3. Runtime dependencies
-----------------------

Python and npm packages declared in `firecrawl/`, `opencve/web/requirements.txt`
and `vulntracker-ui/package.json` are fetched at install time and are not
redistributed in this repository. They remain under their own licenses.


Note on directory naming
------------------------

The top-level `firecrawl/` directory is ORIGINAL SecureScope code. It is a
client for the hosted Firecrawl API (https://api.firecrawl.dev) plus the
collector/aggregator pipeline built on top of it. It does not contain any
source from the Firecrawl project (https://github.com/firecrawl/firecrawl).
